tem\":{\"id\":\"item_11\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc 'rg -n \\\"FilesDrawer|BrowserPane|Button|CardHeader|useChatScroll|Anti-pattern|Core Principle|What Not to Test|Hook Logic Boundary|Test Survival Rule\\\" skills/frontend/PATTERNS.md skills/frontend/TESTING.md'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\",\"exit_code\":null,\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\n+{\"type\":\"command_run\",\"dispatch_id\":\"01KQR3P1JZMY30DGRE9CM15A0W\",\"ts\":\"2026-05-03T23:46:05Z\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc 'rg -n \\\"FilesDrawer|BrowserPane|Button|CardHeader|useChatScroll|Anti-pattern|Core Principle|What Not to Test|Hook Logic Boundary|Test Survival Rule\\\" skills/frontend/PATTERNS.md skills/frontend/TESTING.md'\"}\n+{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_11\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc 'rg -n \\\"FilesDrawer|BrowserPane|Button|CardHeader|useChatScroll|Anti-pattern|Core Principle|What Not to Test|Hook Logic Boundary|Test Survival Rule\\\" skills/frontend/PATTERNS.md skills/frontend/TESTING.md'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"skills/frontend/TESTING.md:3:## Core Principle\\nskills/frontend/TESTING.md:14:render(<FilesDrawer open onClose={onClose} mode=\\\"drawer\\\" />)\\nskills/frontend/TESTING.md:42:## What Not to Test\\nskills/frontend/TESTING.md:54:## Hook Logic Boundary\\nskills/frontend/TESTING.md:62:## Test Survival Rule\\nskills/frontend/PATTERNS.md:7:### FilesDrawer - small prop interface owning a workflow\\nskills/frontend/PATTERNS.md:12:interface FilesDrawerProps {\\nskills/frontend/PATTERNS.md:21:### BrowserPane - derives state from props\\nskills/frontend/PATTERNS.md:36:### Button - design system leaf\\nskills/frontend/PATTERNS.md:41:function Button({\\nskills/frontend/PATTERNS.md:47:}: ButtonProps) {\\nskills/frontend/PATTERNS.md:61:### Card + CardHeader - compound component pattern\\nskills/frontend/PATTERNS.md:76:function CardHeader({ className, ...props }: React.ComponentProps<\\\"div\\\">) {\\nskills/frontend/PATTERN