{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba skills/react-perf/SKILL.md | sed -n '3840,4005p'\"","aggregated_output":"  3840\t- Form controls need `<label>` or `aria-label`\n  3841\t- Interactive elements need keyboard handlers (`onKeyDown`/`onKeyUp`)\n  3842\t- `<button>` for actions, `<a>`/`<Link>` for navigation (not `<div onClick>`)\n  3843\t- Images need `alt` (or `alt=\"\"` if decorative)\n  3844\t- Decorative icons need `aria-hidden=\"true\"`\n  3845\t- Async updates (toasts, validation) need `aria-live=\"polite\"`\n  3846\t- Use semantic HTML (`<button>`, `<a>`, `<label>`, `<table>`) before ARIA\n  3847\t- Headings hierarchical `<h1>`–`<h6>`; include skip link for main content\n  3848\t- `scroll-margin-top` on heading anchors\n  3849\t\n  3850\t### Focus States\n  3851\t\n  3852\t- Interactive elements need visible focus: `focus-visible:ring-*` or equivalent\n  3853\t- Never `outline-none` / `outline: none` without focus replacement\n  3854\t- Use `:focus-visible` over `:focus` (avoid focus ring on click)\n  3855\t- Group focus with `:focus-within` for compound controls\n  3856\t\n  3857\t### Forms\n  3858\t\n  3859\t- Inputs need `autocomplete` and meaningful `name`\n  3860\t- Use correct `type` (`email`, `tel`, `url`, `number`) and `inputmode`\n  3861\t- Never block paste (`onPaste` + `preventDefault`)\n  3862\t- Labels clickable (`htmlFor` or wrapping control)\n  3863\t- Disable spellcheck on emails, codes, usernames (`spellCheck={false}`)\n  3864\t- Checkboxes/radios: label + control share single hit target (no dead zones)\n  3865\t- Submit button stays enabled until request starts; spinner during request\n  3866\t- Errors inline next to fields; focus first error on submit\n  3867\t- Placeholders end with `…` and show example pattern\n  3868\t- `autocomplete=\"off\"` on non-auth fields to avoid password manager triggers\n  3869\t- Warn before navigation with unsaved changes (`beforeunload` or router guard)\n  3870\t\n  3871\t### Animation\n  3872\t\n  3873\t- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion` (provide reduced variant or disable)\n  3874\t- Animate `transform`/`opacity` only (compositor-friendly)\n  3875\t- Never `transition: all`—list properties explicitly\n  3876\t- Set correct `transform-origin`\n  3877\t- SVG: transforms on `<g>` wrapper with `transform-box: fill-box; transform-origin: center`\n  3878\t- Animations interruptible—respond to user input mid-animation\n  3879\t\n  3880\t### Typography\n  3881\t\n  3882\t- `…` not `...`\n  3883\t- Curly quotes `\"` `\"` not straight `\"`\n  3884\t- Non-breaking spaces: `10&nbsp;MB`, `⌘&nbsp;K`, brand names\n  3885\t- Loading states end with `…`: `\"Loading…\"`, `\"Saving…\"`\n  3886\t- `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums` for number columns/comparisons\n  3887\t- Use `text-wrap: balance` or `text-pretty` on headings (prevents widows)\n  3888\t\n  3889\t### Content Handling\n  3890\t\n  3891\t- Text containers handle long content: `truncate`, `line-clamp-*`, or `break-words`\n  3892\t- Flex children need `min-w-0` to allow text truncation\n  3893\t- Handle empty states—don't render broken UI for empty strings/arrays\n  3894\t- User-generated content: anticipate short, average, and very long inputs\n  3895\t\n  3896\t### Images\n  3897\t\n  3898\t- `<img>` needs explicit `width` and `height` (prevents CLS)\n  3899\t- Below-fold images: `loading=\"lazy\"`\n  3900\t- Above-fold critical images: `priority` or `fetchpriority=\"high\"`\n  3901\t\n  3902\t### Performance\n  3903\t\n  3904\t- Large lists (>50 items): virtualize (`virtua`, `content-visibility: auto`)\n  3905\t- No layout reads in render (`getBoundingClientRect`, `offsetHeight`, `offsetWidth`, `scrollTop`)\n  3906\t- Batch DOM reads/writes; avoid interleaving\n  3907\t- Prefer uncontrolled inputs; controlled inputs must be cheap per keystroke\n  3908\t- Add `<link rel=\"preconnect\">` for CDN/asset domains\n  3909\t- Critical fonts: `<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"font\">` with `font-display: swap`\n  3910\t\n  3911\t### Navigation & State\n  3912\t\n  3913\t- URL reflects state—filters, tabs, pagination, expanded panels in query params\n  3914\t- Links use `<a>`/`<Link>` (Cmd/Ctrl+click, middle-click support)\n  3915\t- Deep-link all stateful UI (if uses `useState`, consider URL sync via nuqs or similar)\n  3916\t- Destructive actions need confirmation modal or undo window—never immediate\n  3917\t\n  3918\t### Touch & Interaction\n  3919\t\n  3920\t- `touch-action: manipulation` (prevents double-tap zoom delay)\n  3921\t- `-webkit-tap-highlight-color` set intentionally\n  3922\t- `overscroll-behavior: contain` in modals/drawers/sheets\n  3923\t- During drag: disable text selection, `inert` on dragged elements\n  3924\t- `autoFocus` sparingly—desktop only, single primary input; avoid on mobile\n  3925\t\n  3926\t### Safe Areas & Layout\n  3927\t\n  3928\t- Full-bleed layouts need `env(safe-area-inset-*)` for notches\n  3929\t- Avoid unwanted scrollbars: `overflow-x-hidden` on containers, fix content overflow\n  3930\t- Flex/grid over JS measurement for layout\n  3931\t\n  3932\t### Dark Mode & Theming\n  3933\t\n  3934\t- `color-scheme: dark` on `<html>` for dark themes (fixes scrollbar, inputs)\n  3935\t- `<meta name=\"theme-color\">` matches page background\n  3936\t- Native `<select>`: explicit `background-color` and `color` (Windows dark mode)\n  3937\t\n  3938\t### Locale & i18n\n  3939\t\n  3940\t- Dates/times: use `Intl.DateTimeFormat` not hardcoded formats\n  3941\t- Numbers/currency: use `Intl.NumberFormat` not hardcoded formats\n  3942\t- Detect language via `Accept-Language` / `navigator.languages`, not IP\n  3943\t- Brand names, code tokens, identifiers: wrap with `translate=\"no\"` to prevent garbled auto-translation\n  3944\t\n  3945\t### Hydration Safety\n  3946\t\n  3947\t- Inputs with `value` need `onChange` (or use `defaultValue` for uncontrolled)\n  3948\t- Date/time rendering: guard against hydration mismatch (server vs client)\n  3949\t- `suppressHydrationWarning` only where truly needed\n  3950\t\n  3951\t### Hover & Interactive States\n  3952\t\n  3953\t- Buttons/links need `hover:` state (visual feedback)\n  3954\t- Interactive states increase contrast: hover/active/focus more prominent than rest\n  3955\t\n  3956\t### Content & Copy\n  3957\t\n  3958\t- Active voice: \"Install the CLI\" not \"The CLI will be installed\"\n  3959\t- Title Case for headings/buttons (Chicago style)\n  3960\t- Numerals for counts: \"8 deployments\" not \"eight\"\n  3961\t- Specific button labels: \"Save API Key\" not \"Continue\"\n  3962\t- Error messages include fix/next step, not just problem\n  3963\t- Second person; avoid first person\n  3964\t- `&` over \"and\" where space-constrained\n  3965\t\n  3966\t### Anti-patterns (flag these)\n  3967\t\n  3968\t- `user-scalable=no` or `maximum-scale=1` disabling zoom\n  3969\t- `onPaste` with `preventDefault`\n  3970\t- `transition: all`\n  3971\t- `outline-none` without focus-visible replacement\n  3972\t- Inline `onClick` navigation without `<a>`\n  3973\t- `<div>` or `<span>` with click handlers (should be `<button>`)\n  3974\t- Images without dimensions\n  3975\t- Large arrays `.map()` without virtualization\n  3976\t- Form inputs without labels\n  3977\t- Icon buttons without `aria-label`\n  3978\t- Hardcoded date/number formats (use `Intl.*`)\n  3979\t- `autoFocus` without clear justification\n  3980\t\n  3981\t## Output Format\n  3982\t\n  3983\tGroup by file. Use `file:line` format (VS Code clickable). Terse findings.\n  3984\t\n  3985\t```text\n  3986\t## src/Button.tsx\n  3987\t\n  3988\tsrc/Button.tsx:42 - icon button missing aria-label\n  3989\tsrc/Button.tsx:18 - input lacks label\n  3990\tsrc/Button.tsx:55 - animation missing prefers-reduced-motion\n  3991\tsrc/Button.tsx:67 - transition: all → list properties\n  3992\t\n  3993\t## src/Modal.tsx\n  3994\t\n  3995\tsrc/Modal.tsx:12 - missing overscroll-behavior: contain\n  3996\tsrc/Modal.tsx:34 - \"...\" → \"…\"\n  3997\t\n  3998\t## src/Card.tsx\n  3999\t\n  4000\t✓ pass\n  4001\t```\n  4002\t\n  4003\tState issue + location. Skip explanation unless fix non-obvious. No preamble.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
